      "art": "art.ugarit.palace-hall"
    },
    "what": {
      "text": "\"For a man to know that the palace remembers him.\" He holds out a small pouch without quite touching it. \"That is all you need, and more than you want.\"\n\nThe pouch stays in his hand until you take it.",
      "beatArt": [
        "art.ugarit.palace-hall",
